12. Conclusion

This project demonstrated the application of supervised machine learning techniques for stroke prediction. Five classification algorithms were implemented and evaluated using multiple performance metrics. The comparison helped identify the most suitable model for the dataset. The developed Streamlit application provides a simple interface for uploading test data, selecting a model, and generating predictions, making the solution suitable for practical demonstration.

